t | needs_clarification"}\n\nrow_selector 说明：rank 是正整数，表示按 order_by 排序后取第几行；direction 只能是 "asc" 或\n"desc"（取最大用 desc、最小用 asc），不得使用 top/bottom 等词；value_role 表示用于排序的值，\n可选 "value | current | previous | difference | growth_rate"。\n\n假设使用规则：\n- new_hypotheses 元素结构：{"id": "h1", "statement": "下降主要由销售订单数减少导致",\n  "status": "pending", "evidence_ids": []}；\n- 假设先创建、后验证：validate_hypothesis 只能引用之前轮次已创建成功的 hypothesis_id；\n- 收口时机：当 state.covered_dimension_refs 已覆盖完成研究目标所需的全部 scope 维度、\n  或没有未探索的允许方向时，必须返回 finish（sufficient_evidence 或 no_new_direction），\n  不得继续提交重复或无效动作。\n\nexecute 决策示例：\n{\n  "assessment": {\n    "goal_progress": "partial",\n    "evidence_summary": "目标指标确认下降，但尚未定位主要对象",\n    "information_gap": "需要按允许维度拆分差值"\n  },\n  "hypothesis_updates": [],\n  "new_hypotheses": [],\n  "decision": {\n    "type": "execute",\n    "actions": [\n      {\n        "type": "breakdown",\n        "metric_ref": "METRIC:...",\n        "dimension_ref": "DIMENSION:...",\n        "calculation": "difference",\n        "time_roles": ["current", "previous"]\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}', 'role': 'system'}, {'content': '请根据以下研究上下文返回 ResearchPolicyDecision：\n{"asset_catalog": [{"asset_type": "DIMENSION", "biz_name": "stat_date", "description": "", "display_name": "统计日期", "ref": "DIMENSION:276:246"}, {"asset_type": "DIMENSION", "biz_name": "seller_id", "description": "", "display_name": "商家ID", "ref": "DIMENSION:277:246"}, {"asset_type": "DIMENSION", "biz_name": "stall_id", "description": "", "display_name": "档口ID", "ref": "DIMENSION:278:246"}, {"asset_type": "DIMENSION", "biz_name": "created_at", "description": "", "display_name": "记录创建时间", "ref": "DIMENSION:279:246"}, {"asset_type": "DIMENSION", "biz_name": "updated_at", "description": "", "display_name": "记录更新时间", "ref": "DIMENSION:280:246"}, {"asset_type": "METRIC", "biz_name": "order_cnt_sale", "description": "销售订单数：基于字段 order_cnt_sale 按模型粒度汇总。", "display_name": "销售订单数", "ref": "METRIC:263:246"}, {"asset_type": "METRIC", "biz_name": "item_qty_sale",