DIMENSION:277):**\n- 10002: -22226.64 (largest, ~53% of total -42030), item_qty -59, AOV -1213.24, order_cnt +3\n- 10001: -19803.75, item_qty -59, AOV -618.28, order_cnt -2\n\n**Stall direction (DIMENSION:278):**\n- 100013: -16399.92 (largest, ~39% of total), item_qty 76→6 (-70), AOV -1544.84, order_cnt -1\n- 100021: -8242.76, 100022: -7024.12, 100023: -6959.76\n\nThe cause in both directions is a dual decline: quantity sold dropped sharply AND AOV dropped, while order counts stayed roughly flat — so the loss comes from smaller baskets and lower unit prices, not fewer orders.\n\nI have enough evidence to finalize.', 'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_00_Hq4pOynFPaacZedjnuLD7673', 'function': {'name': 'finish_research', 'arguments': '{"reason": "sufficient_evidence", "summary": "总GMV从6月28日的141225.27降至6月29日的99194.88，下降42030.39。商家方向与档口方向下降额完全对账一致（均-42030.39）。下降最集中的对象：商家方向为10002（-22226.64，约占总下降53%），其次10001（-19803.75）；档口方向为100013（-16399.92，约39%），其次100021（-8242.76）、100022（-7024.12）、100023（-6959.76）。原因分析：两个方向的GMV下降均由「销量(件数)下滑 + 客单价(AOV)下滑」双重驱动，而订单数基本持平甚至上升。商家10002件数-59、AOV-1213.24，但订单+3，说明是每单件数变少且单价下降所致；档口100013件数从76骤降至6（-70）、AOV-1544.84，订单仅-1，属典型的量价齐跌。整体订单量未明显减少，核心问题是单笔价值（件数与单价）塌缩。", "claims": [{"statement": "总GMV下降最集中的商家对象是10002，下降22226.64，约占总下降的53%；其下降源于件数-59与AOV-1213.24的双重下滑，而订单数+3基本持平。", "evidence_ids": ["evidence:research-query-a112f3c9951217f1", "evidence:research-query-65d4492902e37f4a"], "claim_level": "contribution", "confidence": "high"}, {"statement": "总GMV下降最集中的档口对象是100013，下降16399.92，约占总下降的39%；件数从76骤降至6(-70)、AOV-1544.84，订单仅-1，属量价齐跌。", "evidence_ids": ["evidence:research-query-5ea62cf84ff50a7f", "evidence:research-query-f0283438982d8432"], "claim_level": "contribution", "confidence": "high"}, {"statement": "商家10002由其下档口100021(-8242.76)、100022(-7024.12)、100023(-6959.76)共同贡献下降，三个档口件数与AOV均下滑。", "evidence_ids": ["evidence:research-query-a3be53db7571dcec", "evidence:research-query-f0283438982d8432"], "claim_level": "correlation_clue", "confidence": "medium"}, {"statement": "GMV下降的共同原因是非订单量的量价双降：各档口订单数基本持平或上升，而件数和AOV普遍下降，说明客单价价值（件数与单价）塌缩是主因。", "evidence_ids": ["evidence:research-query-65d4492902e37f4a", "evidence:research-query-f0283438982d8432"], "claim_level": "common_change", "confidence": "high"}], "findings": [{"statement": "商家方向最集中的GMV下降对象为10002，下降22226.64（占总下降53%），由件数-59与AOV-1213.24驱动。", "evidence_ids": ["evidence:research-query-a112f3c9951217f1", "evidence:research-query-65d4492902e37f4a"], "statement_kind": "correlational", "confidence": "high"}, {"statement": "档口方向最集中的GMV下降对象为100013，下降16399.92（占总下降39%），由件数-70与AOV-1544.84驱动。", "evidence_ids": ["evidence:research-query-5ea62cf84ff50a7f", "evidence:research-query-f0283438982d8432"], "statement_kind": "correlational", "confidence": "high"}, {"statement": "商家与档口方向的GMV下降对账一致（均-42030.39），下降具有一致性。", "evidence_ids": ["evidence:research-query-a112f3c9951217f1", "evidence:research-query-5ea62cf84ff50a7f"], "statement_kind": "correlational", "confidence": "high"}], "limitations": ["驱动指标仅含件数、AOV、订单数，未分析退款/价格变动等更深层因素。", "档口100013等下降对象的价格/品类细节未单独下钻，量价齐跌的具体业务诱因（如缺货、调价、清仓）无法仅凭当前证据区分。"], "unanswered_questions": ["档口100013件数从76骤降至6的具体原因（断货/下架/调价）无法仅凭现有指标确定。", "AOV普遍下滑是单价下降还是件数减少所致，需进一步拆分每单件数与单价结构。"]}'}}]}, {'content': '{"tool_call_id":"call_00_Hq4pOynFPaacZedjnuLD7673","tool_name":"finish_research","status":"failed","message":"参数不合法：Value error, RESEARCH_AGENT_FINISH_CLAIM_CITATION_MISSING","evidence_ids":[],"statistics":{},"limitations":[],"sample_rows":[],"error":{"code":"INVALID_REQUEST","stage":"validation","retryable":false,"same_parameter_retryable":false,"suggested_corrections":["Value error, RESEARCH_AGENT_FINISH_CLAIM_CITATION_MISSING"]}}', 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_00_Hq4pOynFPaacZedjnuLD7673'}, {'content': '<agent-working-state>{"iteration":3,"goal":"找出总GMV下降最集中的对象，从商家和档口两个方向分析原因","reason":"open_ended_cause","target_metric_refs":["METRIC:271:246"],"premise_to_verify":null,"premise_result":null,"immutable_filters":[],"time_bindings