imension_value, SUM(metric_value) AS metric_value FROM ranked WHERE row_number > 3) SELECT dimension_value, metric_value FROM top_rows UNION ALL SELECT dimension_value, metric_value FROM other_row WHERE metric_value IS NOT NULL"}, {"answer_brief": "2026年6月29日相比6月28日，线上渠道GMV下降37443.83，降幅30.96%；线下渠道GMV下降4586.56，降幅22.62%。", "question": "对比2026年6月29日和6月28日各交易渠道的客户当日GMV，计算每个渠道的差值和增长率。", "sql": "SELECT COALESCE(i0.\\"channel_type\\", i1.\\"channel_type\\") AS \\"channel_type\\", i0.\\"customer_gmv_current\\" AS \\"customer_gmv_current__c:差值\\", i0.\\"customer_gmv_previous\\" AS \\"customer_gmv_previous__c:差值\\", i0.\\"customer_gmv_difference\\" AS \\"customer_gmv_difference\\", i1.\\"customer_gmv_current\\" AS \\"customer_gmv_current__c:增长率\\", i1.\\"customer_gmv_previous\\" AS \\"customer_gmv_previous__c:增长率\\", i1.\\"customer_gmv_growth_rate\\" AS \\"customer_gmv_growth_rate\\" FROM input_0 i0 FULL OUTER JOIN input_1 i1 ON COALESCE(i0.\\"channel_type\\") IS NOT DISTINCT FROM i1.\\"channel_type\\""}], "last_rewrite_question": "对比2026年6月29日和6月28日各交易渠道的客户当日GMV，计算每个渠道的差值和增长率。"}, "current_question": "2026年6月29日客户当日GMV较6月28日下降，请从交易渠道和客户两个方向分析，并验证订单数、购买件数和新增成交客户数的变化。", "reference_datetime": "2026-08-24T02:48:27.823331+00:00", "timezone": "UTC"}', 'role': 'user'}], 'model': 'deepseek-v4-flash', 'reasoning_effort': 'none', 'response_format': {'type': 'json_object'}, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0}}
